t1-revive @VERSION@ -- corresponding source for the bundled libimobiledevice stack
=====================================================================================

The binaries under prefix/ (idevicerestore, irecovery, plistutil, usbmuxd and the
lib*.so they load) were built from the upstream git commits below plus, where listed,
one patch from vendor/patches/ of the t1-revive source tree. That combination is the
complete corresponding source in the sense of the LGPL-2.1, LGPL-3.0 and GPL-2.0/3.0
licences under which those projects are distributed. Configure flags and build order
are in build.sh; `bash build.sh --offline` rebuilds them bit-for-bit modulo toolchain.

